{"id":"e71245fcb536dc32","group":"58","path":"58/batch01/58-thm-generic-cta.md","title":"Existence of a Set-Model Generic Extension","display":"thm-generic-cta — Existence of a Set-Model Generic Extension","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-thm-generic-cta","aliases":["58-thm-generic-cta"],"display":"thm-generic-cta — Existence of a Set-Model Generic Extension","depends_on":["[[../batch06/58-df-ctm]]","[[../batch16/58-df-generic]]","[[../batch15/58-df-zfc-forcing2-forcing-poset]]","[[../batch19/58-df-zfc-transitive-model]]","[[../batch15/58-df-zfc-geology-set-forcing-extension]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-thm-generic-cta"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-thm-generic-cta</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-generic-cta — Existence of a Set-Model Generic Extension"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"66d43bb76d055059\" href=\"?note=66d43bb76d055059\" title=\"../batch06/58-df-ctm\">../batch06/58-df-ctm</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"545853811ce0a4b6\" href=\"?note=545853811ce0a4b6\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-generic\">../batch16/58-df-generic</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"b5833df5ef175153\" href=\"?note=b5833df5ef175153\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-zfc-forcing2-forcing-poset\">../batch15/58-df-zfc-forcing2-forcing-poset</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"a9132c2c1a18acd1\" href=\"?note=a9132c2c1a18acd1\" title=\"../batch19/58-df-zfc-transitive-model\">../batch19/58-df-zfc-transitive-model</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"1de28866aa4ef668\" href=\"?note=1de28866aa4ef668\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-zfc-geology-set-forcing-extension\">../batch15/58-df-zfc-geology-set-forcing-extension</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\\in V\">\\(M\\in V\\)</span> (a countable transitive set model of ZFC)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(P,\\leq_P,1_P)\\in M\">\\((P,\\leq_P,1_P)\\in M\\)</span> (forcing-poset data) and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\\subseteq P\">\\(G\\subseteq P\\)</span> (an <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\">\\(M\\)</span>-generic filter)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CTM}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{CTM}_S\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TransitiveModel}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{TransitiveModel}_S\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcForcing2ForcingPoset}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcForcing2ForcingPoset}_S\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Generic}\">\\(\\mathrm{Generic}\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcGeologySetForcingExtension}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcGeologySetForcingExtension}_S\\)</span> (predicates from the dependencies)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}generic\\text{-}cta}\\vdash\n\\forall M,P,\\leq_P,1_P,G\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{CTM}_S(M,\\operatorname{ZFC})\n\\land\\mathrm{TransitiveModel}_S(M)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land P,\\leq_P,1_P\\in M\n\\land\\mathrm{ZfcForcing2ForcingPoset}_S(P,\\leq_P,1_P)\n\\land\\mathrm{Generic}(G,P,\\leq_P,M)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\to\\exists N\\in V\\;\n\\mathrm{ZfcGeologySetForcingExtension}_S(N,M,P,G)\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}generic\\text{-}cta}\\vdash\n\\forall M,P,\\leq_P,1_P,G\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{CTM}_S(M,\\operatorname{ZFC})\n\\land\\mathrm{TransitiveModel}_S(M)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land P,\\leq_P,1_P\\in M\n\\land\\mathrm{ZfcForcing2ForcingPoset}_S(P,\\leq_P,1_P)\n\\land\\mathrm{Generic}(G,P,\\leq_P,M)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\to\\exists N\\in V\\;\n\\mathrm{ZfcGeologySetForcingExtension}_S(N,M,P,G)\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The conclusion is the registered generic-extension relation for set-coded models. The former conclusion used <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{GroundModel}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{GroundModel}_S\\)</span>, whose arguments are transitive proper classes containing all ordinals, and therefore could not accept the countable set model <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\">\\(M\\)</span>.</li>\n<li>Trivial forcing may give <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"N=M\">\\(N=M\\)</span>; no unsupported properness clause <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\\subsetneq N\">\\(M\\subsetneq N\\)</span> is imposed.</li>\n<li>The chosen forcing order is explicit in the genericity premise, while the extension relation constructs <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"N\">\\(N\\)</span> from the evaluations of the <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P\">\\(P\\)</span>-names in <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\">\\(M\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch06/58-df-ctm","status":"resolved","id":"66d43bb76d055059","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch06/58-df-ctm]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-generic","status":"resolved","id":"545853811ce0a4b6","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-generic]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch15/58-df-zfc-forcing2-forcing-poset","status":"resolved","id":"b5833df5ef175153","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch15/58-df-zfc-forcing2-forcing-poset]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch19/58-df-zfc-transitive-model","status":"resolved","id":"a9132c2c1a18acd1","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch19/58-df-zfc-transitive-model]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch15/58-df-zfc-geology-set-forcing-extension","status":"resolved","id":"1de28866aa4ef668","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch15/58-df-zfc-geology-set-forcing-extension]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"M\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"(P,\\leq_P,1_P)\\in M","display":false},{"tex":"G\\subseteq P","display":false},{"tex":"M","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CTM}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{TransitiveModel}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcForcing2ForcingPoset}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Generic}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcGeologySetForcingExtension}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n&\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}generic\\text{-}cta}\\vdash\n\\forall M,P,\\leq_P,1_P,G\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{CTM}_S(M,\\operatorname{ZFC})\n\\land\\mathrm{TransitiveModel}_S(M)\\\\\n&\\quad\\land P,\\leq_P,1_P\\in M\n\\land\\mathrm{ZfcForcing2ForcingPoset}_S(P,\\leq_P,1_P)\n\\land\\mathrm{Generic}(G,P,\\leq_P,M)\\\\\n&\\quad\\to\\exists N\\in V\\;\n\\mathrm{ZfcGeologySetForcingExtension}_S(N,M,P,G)\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{GroundModel}_S","display":false},{"tex":"M","display":false},{"tex":"N=M","display":false},{"tex":"M\\subsetneq N","display":false},{"tex":"N","display":false},{"tex":"P","display":false},{"tex":"M","display":false}],"bytes":1791,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-4176","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch01/58-thm-generic-cta.md|58-thm-generic-cta]]（batch01）"}],"outgoing":["66d43bb76d055059","545853811ce0a4b6","b5833df5ef175153","a9132c2c1a18acd1","1de28866aa4ef668"]}